{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"I am adding another sheet and scribbling a bit more, although I am dull and tired — from standing and walking all day in the Esterházy Gallery and in Schönbrunn, where I ate; since the Italian opera is about to begin in half an hour, I will not engage in any further reports, only that it cleared up yesterday afternoon, and today the weather is the most beautiful in the world, not too hot and promising consistency. — Flesh and blood have struggled with the will — to hasten to meet you from here on Friday, October 1st; however, you give me permission to stay longer, I have seen and enjoyed everything in the whirlwind; I have been diligent, on my feet all day, and there is still much to see; — in order to preserve the good and create for myself a treasure of memory, I must see it once more, — of course I will not see the Italian opera for a second time; the beautiful, infinitely varied, lovely countryside I have only just experienced today, and savored in what beautiful sunshine."}}],"created":1795220803,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":219,"prompt_tokens":319,"total_tokens":538,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-vT6kgaCX5WLvtyMPckCrfButKqB46JXs","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":319,"prompt_ms":567.635,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.7794200626959247,"prompt_per_second":561.9808503703965,"predicted_n":219,"predicted_ms":5162.489,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.68114220183486,"predicted_per_second":42.227692882251176}}